WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it’s this!

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.790
It has 3000 attack points!

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:14.910
Once a turn, it can bring out a 
Level 1 or 2 monster from your deck.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.700
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:13.800
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:18.710
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:23.480
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:28.840
No matter how bad today is

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.830
There’s still the faintest light

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:39.230
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:43.290
Is light it myself

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:48.300
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:53.270
Even if I get countless scars

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:59.570
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:03.550
Today will never exist again

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:09.450
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:38.790
Battle!  The Man With the Spider Mark

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:52.820
Destiny is guiding the son of Professor 
Fudo, the creator of the previous Moment.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:58.990
I want to know the details about the 
previous Moment and Yusei’s father.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:08.700
17 years ago, Zero Reverse altered the 
earth’s crust and separated Satellite and the City.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:12.750
It was actually caused when the first Moment,

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:17.050
located in the innermost part 
of Satellite, malfunctioned.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:23.380
The person in charge of MIDS, the Moment 
development section, was Yusei’s father.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:28.150
That means due to that accident, 
Yusei’s father was…

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.360
Yusei’s father was…

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:35.590
That’s why he knows 
why family is important.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:41.320
Wait a second.  Why would someone born in 
Satellite be in charge of such a large project?

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.940
Yusei was born in the City.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:48.860
What?  He’s not Satellite garbage?

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:52.900
I was born in Satellite!  Do 
you have a problem with that?

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.380
No…

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:01.240
This is bad.  This isn’t normal lightning.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:05.490
If we’re struck, it’s all 
over.  Shouldn't we go back?

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:08.390
We're not allowed to retreat!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.410
I’m just worried about you.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.130
Land there.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.890
Land!

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.770
Yusei?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.120
Jack!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.600
It is you, Jack!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.420
Martha.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.100
I can’t believe how much you’ve grown!

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.130
Because it’s been years since I left.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:49.270
Now just like before, do your king thing.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.400
A king admires a lady.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.980
You really are a good kid!

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:07.050
Martha, that’s enough!

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.450
Welcome back, Yusei!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.710
It really is Jack!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:15.360
I thought Satellite would be a scarier place.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.830
There are happy kids here.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:21.830
You think so?  Satellite is still Satellite.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.580
You never change.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.350
Why are you hanging out with them?

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:27.700
You’re...

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:29.810
From before!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:38.120
I only came because the Director forced me!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.250
No one intentionally wants to come here!

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.750
What?

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:50.800
It doesn't matter if I'm 
not popular with the kids.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.890
I just want to be popular with her.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.470
Who are you?

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.700
Mister, are you Security?

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.990
What if I am?

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:03.470
You’re cool!  I want 
to wear that uniform too!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:09.180
I see!  No one else looks 
this good in a uniform!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:15.980
Martha, is everyone in Satellite safe?

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.930
Yesterday, a black fog 
suddenly covered Satellite.

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:30.680
When the fog cleared, the people 
in the area mysteriously vanished.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.500
Vanished?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:39.080
Yes, most of them.  Since the fog 
didn’t reach here, we were safe.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.360
Rally, Taka, Nerve, Blitz 
and Crow haven’t returned.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.530
What?

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:47.610
I hope it’s some mistake.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.160
Are those people Yusei’s friends?

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.290
Yes.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.730
Are you Congressman Izayoi’s…

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.960
Yes, I’m his daughter Aki.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:06.250
I see!  Yusei, you were able to open 
this girl’s heart.  That’s good.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:13.830
And what about you?  Are 
you still afraid of Kiryu?

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:14.780
Yeah.

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:20.550
Earthbound Immortal is a scary card that 
activates by absorbing people’s souls.

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:25.230
Honestly, I’m scared of that card.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.510
But I have this many friends.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:33.110
Don't get the wrong idea.  
I'm not your friend.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:40.020
When I know how my friends feel, 
I believe I can overcome my fear.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:44.710
Besides, Kiryu used to be my friend.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.260
Well said.  That’s why you’re Yusei.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:51.510
I know you’re going to the 
Dark Signers' headquarters.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:58.420
But it’s already late, so stay here 
for tonight.  I'll prepare dinner.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:01.610
What’s with the "how 
my friends feel" speech?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.490
A tulip.  Maybe it's too early, but so what.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:10.580
I’ll give this to Mikage.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.800
Mikage.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.420
Ushio.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.680
How long have you been there?

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.480
Stop following me!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.330
Shoo shoo!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:35.470
Master Atlas, you said that 
you weren’t his friend.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.870
Then why did you come to Satellite?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.960
Don't ask me any questions.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:43.970
I know it's because of Carly.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:48.440
No!  Master Atlas, I-

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.870
Don’t say it!  Calm down!

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:53.320
I owe her.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:09:00.320
If she’s in pain, I'll do 
whatever it takes to rescue her.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.320
And that's it.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:03.900
Master Atlas…

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.000
Ouch!

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.410
What are you doing?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.840
We’re making dinner, and 
you’re going to help.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:28.320
Wait a second!  I’m a guest!

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:32.080
I don’t think so!  Now start working!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.490
Ouch!

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:38.610
Hot!

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:45.100
Why do I even have to clean the bathroom?

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.710
Stop complaining!

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:48.970
You…

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:50.260
I’ll help too!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.370
Thanks.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.490
Thanks for the help.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:06.400
Shouldn't you treat people less rudely?

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:11.470
By being physically active, hasn't it 
taken your mind off of your problems?

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:17.950
If you move your body and work, the pain 
of a broken heart doesn't hurt at all.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:23.930
The people of Satellite are experts when 
it comes to overcoming sadness and pain.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:28.720
Even him.  Takuya’s father 
died during a robbery.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:37.630
But he never forget how Security did 
their best to try to save his father.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.300
He wants to join Security when he grows up.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.200
He changed sadness into gratitude and hope.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.240
He's working hard at living.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:48.550
That’s why he keeps following me…

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.680
But since he was born in Satellite, 
he can’t join Security.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:58.050
Nothing in this world is impossible!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.430
Thanks for the meal!

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.000
This stew is delicious!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.290
Yes, it’s delicious!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.930
The Security guy made it.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.410
Well…

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.790
Thank you for the delicious stew.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.050
Thank you!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.390
Hot!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:06.350
If we win our next battle, they will 
build a bridge that connects to the City.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:08.870
And that will end discrimination.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:15.010
Your future will change.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:17.900
It will be an era where you 
can be whatever you want.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.460
Yusei, you’re cool!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:29.740
That’s right.  He may someday 
be able to join Security.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:32.000
And I…

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.110
What is it?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.750
Is everyone okay?

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.350
Who are you?

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.330
My name is Rutger.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.890
A Dark Signer with the spider mark.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:05.650
Spider mark…  Does that mean 
my vision is coming true?

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:11.240
I heard that four Signers arrived, 
so I'm here to welcome you.

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:14.650
We’ll celebrate by having a duel.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:16.690
What?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.160
Jack!  We can’t duel here.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.210
Everyone will be engulfed 
into his fire geoglyph!

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:24.910
I’ll lead him away.

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:27.110
I’m counting on you to 
protect Martha and the kids.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.590
I’ll face you!  Follow me!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.120
Fine.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.720
I’m coming with you.

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:45.940
Hurry up, you guys!

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.940
We're coming right away!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.180
Let’s also go.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:54.180
He’s a bad guy that kidnapped Crow.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.180
We have to defeat him.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:03.590
Let's get started.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.580
Duel!

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.840
This is…

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:27.780
The shape of this geoglyph is different 
than the one we saw in the vision.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.060
It’s started.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.650
Yusei…

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:38.680
Come inside this room.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.520
Takuya is missing.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.960
So is Jun and Mitchan.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.630
What?

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:49.130
That’s…

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:51.120
Martha!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.600
I'll handle it!

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.510
I go first!  I draw!

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:00.180
I summon Shield Wing in defense position!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.020
I end my turn.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.560
My turn.

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.020
I draw!

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:11.920
I activate the Field Spell Spider Web!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.830
What's this field?

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:21.520
Come, Dark Tuner Spider Cocoon!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.730
I can Special Summon this monster

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:29.730
when you have a monster on your 
field but I have none on mine!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:33.350
Then I Normal Summon Dark Spider!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:44.320
Dark Spider can increase the Level of an 
Insect-Type monster on my field by 2 until the End Phase.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:49.190
I raise Spider Cocoon’s Level from 5 to 7.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:55.230
Level 7 Spider Cocoon dark 
tunes Level 1 Dark Spider!

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:13.950
When shadow stacks on shadows, the door to the 
realm of the dead opens.  A world without light!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.950
Dark Synchro!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.870
Come, Underground Arachnid!

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:24.060
A Dark Synchro monster...

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:28.470
However, Shield Wing can't be 
destroyed until the second battle!

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:34.870
It says that it doesn't 
want to be underestimated.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.340
Underground Arachnid’s effect activates!

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:38.980
Twine Thread!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:48.650
Shield Wing is now on his field.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:57.360
Once a turn, a monster on your field 
becomes Underground Arachnid's Equip Card.

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:00.290
Attack Yusei Fudo directly!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:11.940
He instantly lost 2400 life points!

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.180
Yusei…

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.870
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.850
All right!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.850
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:35.130
I summon the Tuner Monster Road Synchron!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:42.540
Then I activate the spell card One for One!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:46.050
I send one monster card in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:49.350
That lets me Special Summon a 
Level 1 monster from my hand!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:57.130
And when I have a face-up 
Tuner Monster on my field...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.050
I can Special Summon Quillbolt 
Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:06.380
The total Level of the three 
monsters on Yusei’s field is 7.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.650
I activate Tuningware’s effect!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:14.700
When this card is used to Synchro 
Summon, it can be treated as Level 2.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.440
That makes it 8.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:22.910
Level 4 Road Synchron tunes Level 2 
Quillbolt Hedgehog and Level 2 Tuningware!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:30.120
Hope comes together to invite a new land!  
Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.020
Synchro Summon!

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.520
Drive through, Road Warrior!

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:40.530
With 3000 attack points, it's 
stronger than Underground Arachnid!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:47.770
Since Tuningware was used to Synchro 
Summon, I get to draw one card!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.240
Battle!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:52.710
Road Warrior attacks Underground Arachnid!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.680
Lightning Claw!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.340
You did it!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.490
What?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:15.970
Underground Arachnid can use the equipped 
monster as a shield to avoid being destroyed.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:20.560
Next, due to the Field Spell 
Spider Web's effect...

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:24.350
...your monster that battled 
switches to defense position,

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.550
and it can’t change 
battle position next turn.

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:31.730
When Underground Arachnid’s thread wraps up

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.730
your monster again on the next 
turn, your field will be empty.

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:40.020
Then I'll attack you directly, and 
you will dance the dance of death.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.980
I’m not good at dancing.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:47.030
Road Warrior’s effect activates!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:52.340
Once a turn, I can Special Summon a 
Level 1 or 2 monster from my deck!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.810
I Special Summon Turbo Booster!

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:00.730
Rally…

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.590
Turbo Booster’s effect activates!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:10.610
By releasing this card, one of your monsters 
that battled against my monster is destroyed!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.350
Go, Turbo Booster!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:23.010
Incredible!  Yusei thoroughly 
planned out his strategy.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.140
Over there!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.040
Yusei!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.490
You’re…

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:30.250
Oh no!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:34.560
If a non-Signer enters the flames…

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:37.710
I flip over my trap card!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.820
Altar of the Bound Deity!

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:42.990
Once a turn during my Standby Phase,

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:49.790
it gains one Earthbound Immortal Counter for every 
face-up defense position monster card on the field.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:58.540
When it has four counters, I can Special 
Summon one Earthbound Immortal monster from my deck!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.240
Earthbound Immortal!

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:03.480
That's the card that damaged Yusei’s soul.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:09.370
It's the terrifying card that absorbs 
people's souls trapped inside the geoglyph.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:11.920
I’m scared!

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:13.810
Their souls will be...

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.190
Jun...  Mitchan…

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.540
Takuya…

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:27.880
Jun, Mitchan, where did you go?

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:32.000
Looks like some rats have sneaked in.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:38.010
This duel can’t be stopped 
until we have a winner.

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:42.540
I have to win before he summons 
an Earthbound Immortal.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:46.020
That's the only way to save those two kids.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:02.350
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:07.420
We will build our own future

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:12.790
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:17.960
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.630 --> 00:22:33.170
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:38.740
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:43.450
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:48.720
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.190
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.770
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.900 --> 00:23:03.580
This journey has no end

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:09.110
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:14.350
